        "# BDFL\n",
        "\n",
        "“Benevolent Dictator For Life” was the title given to Python creator Guido van Rossum in recognition of his former role as the project's final decision-maker.\n",
        "\n",
        "Source: [Python glossary](https://docs.python.org/3/glossary.html#term-BDFL)"
